# R21.1B (B9): local environment is never committed. `.env.example` stays
# tracked as the variable-name contract; the real values come from the
# deploy platform (docs/environment.md). Publishing `.env` is safe today —
# it holds only public VITE_* publishable values — but it is one careless
# secret away from a leak, so it is untracked from RC1 onwards.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

